Hi Karl,

Piling to this discussion, I have ~35000 SNP markers for ~194 F1 siblings and two heterozygous parents that I want to use to make genetic map. The phase information is unknown. Is it advisable to still use R/qtl in this case? Is there a way to determine phase information?
Please bear with me for I am new to this.

Thanks!

