It's possible, but you first need to infer phase and R/qtl offers no facilities for this.

You're probably better off looking at:
  onemap, https://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/onemap
  MapQTL, https://forge-dga.jouy.inra.fr/projects/qtlmap

karl

